@title: A label with an apostrophe is the whole label
STEP 1: Click it
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/apostrophe.html
    CLICK the 'It's Only the Himalayas' link
    VERIFY that 'opened book Himalayas' is present
    VERIFY that 'opened category Spirituality' is NOT present
STEP 2: Fill it, and check it
    FILL 'Driver's licence' field with 'O'Brien 123'
    VERIFY 'Driver's licence' field has value 'O'Brien 123'
DONE.
